==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*5 [[Croco]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*2 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Rin Tohsaka (Enemy)|Rin Tohsaka]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**4 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is hardly a challenge, [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] with good Meatshielding and [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] can handle this stage with minimal issue. [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]] can also quickly eliminate the boss if they can get through the lesser enemies. It is not recommended to use a [[Battle Items#Treasure Radar|Treasure Radar]] to collect [[Li'l Sakura (Special Cat)|Li'l Sakura]], as you can also get them from the following stage with decent odds.

